  "solution": {
    "text": "The particle should be projected such that it can reach halfway because after midpoint it will move under the attraction of 2<sup>nd</sup> ring and will reach the center of the ring.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PE</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>KE</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>KE</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>PE</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GMm</mtext></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GMm</mtext><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mv</mtext><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GMm</mtext><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math>"
